cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper.
title: PolicySplit
abstract: >-
  Policy-aligned fast-path admission for P4-SDN IoT intrusion detection.
  Reference implementation covering PCAP feature extraction, controlled
  context audits, action-aware policy compilation, matched estimators, a P4
  register pipeline, BMv2 replay, and an SDN controller.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/whoisdinanath/PolicySplit
keywords:
  - intrusion detection
  - Internet of Things
  - programmable data planes
  - state space models
  - Mamba
  - software-defined networking
  - CICIoT2023
